    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37125" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξελκ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gain by trading,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρδος ἐ.</span>
